==Battleground==
*2 [[Dogenstein]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Chickful A]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Otta-smack-u]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*3 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Winged Pigge]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Otta-smack-u]] spawns after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>.
**1 [[Henry]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**1 [[Tarsiriel]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Dogenstein]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Chickful A]] spawns after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
At first glance, this stage might seem quite difficult, combining Winged Pigge and Henry, but if you know what your doing, it is quite straightforward. You can lure and freeze the Winged Pigge with [[Master of Mind Soractes (Special Cat)|Master of Mind Catcrates]] and rush it down with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and [[Phantom Cat (Rare Cat)|Bubble Cat]], with [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] as your main meatshield, before the Henry can reach your cats, letting you not have to worry about him freezing your cats. [[Ancient Egg: N005 (Special Cat)|Hitman Cat]] can be used to take care of the Otta-smack-us and Henry after Winged Pigge has been dealt with.

